1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Shaking at highway speed?

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,000
You might be fixing the wrong thing.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,800
Balance and alignment
get mixed up constantly.

4
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:09,000
They are different repairs.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Shaking in the wheel
at speed

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
usually points to
a balance issue.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,500
Pulling to one side, or wear
on just one edge,

8
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,000
usually points to alignment.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,500
Not sure which?
Send this to them —

10
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,500
or bring it by.

11
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:29,000
Nick's Tire and Auto, link in bio.
